 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "A Bimodal Logic for Tense and Modality",
  "excerpt": "This repository implements the **bimodal fragment** of the [Logos](https://logos-labs.ai/) in Lean 4, establishing soundness and completeness for a logic designed for reasoning about future contingency in non-deterministic dynamical systems. The **task semantics** evaluates formulas at both a history and a time, where histories are functions from times to world-states constrained by the task relation which encodes the possible transitions between world-states over a duration of time."
 },
